                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "KnfqK",
                      "fill": "$fg",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "One player leads a card and the others follow in turn. If you hold the suit that was led, you play it. A special card may be played at any time. The highest card of the suit that was led takes the trick, unless something stronger is on the table.",
