                      "fill": "$fg",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Hit your bid and every trick of it counts for you. Miss it and every trick you were off counts against you. A bid of zero pays more the more cards were dealt, and costs as much when it fails.",
